": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3oA1C8zMUuAQ7kNvwEktdSI&_nc_oc=AdofVejxa8K1cQTwQp340xZKfdJULGyaOJrCNyXxoVCh0FIYoRKXZ2Cn5iuEJ3LyVaU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP2ew9aCG1uN1YxXM7lJGjNSajboF6b9I53OhlJJXreeg&oe=6AD0FA1B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=odB6J3Au3q8Q7kNvwHaJie1&_nc_oc=Adrt2UMBhfOXep4xxw7foGKS8Fzvh9pSXGJl0v4VeGrstgWXBZrXXTZh9xJAAfkFhZA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNmniGQOrXey_gp54QQAqmIXpTN_TBIXtu353CnaYZZyw&oe=6AD0EA61"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qymoixMsnBEQ7kNvwF3B2-l&_nc_oc=AdqjeOQ_N9xxMLUGmpi09b5K161_-3mRDGxmD0j-vhFFw8sAFEuMR8QhCYIZXDx1a-M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN5-Dlt8EcXnNYucC1P6jxTah-6K802hhIbMGIxK3pU6w&oe=6AD0D72F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UFUIa1--1EUQ7kNvwEvmzGB&_nc_oc=AdrhqAv5Xb8SlAUnVQrqaRLjUsxaje6OQeq_43xl4MyeCCDKDlcnTAZMSY805u7ogPA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP5lfvCxuQd05VrahAz-S9C70xFTIUEPzrMaR9pzV_IRQ&oe=6AD0D6D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HtIlAdY2o4wQ7kNvwHI7_Pb&_nc_oc=AdpA0-yhtDp10FFOXpFyO8mrg9C_ruVKWxOP6LKLodpE7Gnu8M3k0btiv29BS2-ruGE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMwF0mtW5YEHQkNGP3kymA3LrHQ-84n6_Shxr8k57iLDw&oe=6AD0E07D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a